Homepage: https://github.com/Vaizer0/zero-termux
Description: Subdomain takeover detection tool
 takeover is a subdomain takeover vulnerability scanner that detects
 if domains are vulnerable to takeover by checking for known
 unclaimed services and cloud providers.
